   "source": [
    "pre = df.copy(); log = []\n",
    "for c in [c for c in num if pre[c].isna().any()]:\n",
    "    pre[f\"{c}_missing\"] = pre[c].isna().astype(int); n0 = pre[c].isna().sum()\n",
    "    pre[c] = pre[c].fillna(pre.loc[~pre[\"is_corridor_test\"], c].median())  # mediana SOLO de entrenamiento\n",
    "    log.append([c, n0, \"mediana (entrenamiento) + indicador\"])\n",
    "for c in [c for c in cat if pre[c].isna().any()]:\n",
    "    n0 = pre[c].isna().sum(); pre[c] = pre[c].fillna(\"FALTANTE\"); log.append([c, n0, \"categoría FALTANTE\"])\n",
    "display(pd.DataFrame(log, columns=[\"variable\", \"n_imputados\", \"estrategia\"]))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "184daea1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 6.2 Atípicos\n",
    "No se eliminan sitios: los TDPA extremos (zona metropolitana, libramientos de Cuernavaca) son reales.\n",
    "Estrategia: objetivo en escala log, `log1p` en features sesgadas y modelos robustos (árboles) o escalado robusto."
   ]
  },
